sequenceDiagram
    participant OFAC as OFAC SDN feed
    actor Auth as Ring authority
    actor Crazy as Mr. Crazy's wallet
    participant Photon as Indexer
    participant Ring as Ring program
    participant SPP

    OFAC->>Auth: designates Mr. Evil
    Auth->>Ring: create_record(Block, evil_tag, Active)
    Ring->>Ring: check_mutator, Block is authority held
    Ring->>SPP: 1-in 1-out transact, claims the address, inserts the record UTXO
    Note over SPP: the pair (Block, evil) now has its one lineage

    Crazy->>Photon: read_record(Block, evil_tag)
    Photon-->>Crazy: live Active record
    Note over Crazy: entry() returns PolicyRuleUnsatisfied, no proof is attempted
    Note over Crazy,Ring: a patched wallet fares no better, the claimed address admits no non-inclusion witness, the circuit refuses

    OFAC->>Auth: de-lists Mr. Evil
    Auth->>Ring: update_record(Block, evil_tag, Cleared)
    Ring->>SPP: spends v0, inserts Cleared v1 at the same address

    Crazy->>Photon: proofs for the cleared record and its nullifier
    Crazy->>Crazy: pool slot, absent_branch 2, cleared record
    Crazy->>Ring: transact with one proof
    Ring->>Ring: recomputes POLICY.hash, resolves both roots, verifies
    Ring->>SPP: CPI ring_transact
    Note over SPP: the transfer settles, nothing on chain names Mr. Evil as the recipient
